  "job_B1.3.24_20261116_194931": {
    "chunk_text": "w\u00e6ron twegen kyningas on Crist gelyfde, Abdon \u00d0a asprang heora word to \u00f0am w\u00e6lhreowan casere \u00fee \u00f0a ana geweold ealles middaneardes, and ealle \u00dea asende Decius to \u00feam fores\u00e6dum cyningum, and het hi gebringan on bendum to him, wolde hi Hw\u00e6t \u00fea cwelleras \u00fea \u00fea cynincgas gebundon, and on isenum racenteagum to \u00f0am arleasan gebrohton Decius \u00fea het \u00fea halgan cyningas his godum geoffrian, ac hi andwyrdon \u00feus, We offria\u00f0 ure lac \u00feam \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 Decius, se deofles biggenga, \u00feysum is to gearcigenne \u00fea re\u00feestan wita. Abdon and Sennes him andwyrdon \u00f0us, Hw\u00e6s abitst \u00feu casere? Cy\u00f0 hw\u00e6t \u00feu wylle, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu wite so\u00f0lice \u00fe\u00e6t we orsorge syndon on urum H\u00e6lende Criste, \u00fee h\u00e6f\u00f0 \u00fea \u00dea on \u00feam o\u00f0rum d\u00e6ge het Decius se casere l\u00e6tan leon and beran to \u00feam geleaffullum cynegum, \u00fe\u00e6t hi \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 Ualerianus to \u00feam cynegum \u00feus, Beorga\u00f0 eowrum gebyrdum, and buga\u00f0 to urum godum, and Abdon and Sennes s\u00e6don \u00feam arleasan, We gebidda\u00f0 us to Drihtne gebigdum limum, and we n\u00e6fre ne \u00dea het Ualerianus \u00f0a halgan unscrydan, and l\u00e6dan swa nocode to \u00f0\u00e6re sunnan anlicnysse, for\u00f0an \u00f0e hi \u00dea cw\u00e6don \u00f0a cynegas to \u00feam cwellere \u00f0us, Do \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu don wylt. And se dema het beswingan \u00fea",
